%% Figure 26.5 — Dueling proposers: safe but not live
sequenceDiagram
  participant P1 as Proposer P1
  participant A as Majority A1 to A3
  participant P2 as Proposer P2
  P1->>A: Prepare 1.1
  A-->>P1: Promise 1.1
  P2->>A: Prepare 1.2
  A-->>P2: Promise 1.2
  P1->>A: Accept 1.1, X
  A-->>P1: Reject, promised 1.2
  P1->>A: Prepare 2.1
  A-->>P1: Promise 2.1
